  💡 建议3：测试策略的参数化

  当前（硬编码）：
  "Create tests/test_kubeconfig_current_context_merge.py
   Write two tests:
   - Test 1: cluster:context:user order
   - Test 2: ..."

  建议（参数化）：
  test_strategy:
    file: tests/test_{{bug_id}}.py
    cases:
      - name: "config order precedence"
        input: "cluster:context:user"
        expect_before_fix: ConfigException("current-context")
        expect_after_fix: success, context="kube.example.com"
      - name: "reverse order"
        input: "user:context:cluster"
        expect: same as above

  优势：
  - 结构化，易于生成
  - 减少自然语言歧义
  - 机器可读，可自动验证

